--- !u!114 &761744760
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 761744758}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Goal: Collect the most Gold in 15 turns. If tied on Gold, the player with
    more weapons (Sword, Shield, Bow) wins.\n\nHow to Play: Each turn you plan your
    moves by choosing colored paths (Red, Blue, Yellow) to travel between cities
    and decide whether to interact with what's there. Player locks in their choice,
    moves play out, then the next player goes.\n\nClasses: Merchant starts with 3
    Gold and pays less for ability scrolls. Warrior starts with weapons and loots
    Towers more easily. Wanderer is immune to the Bandit Den.\n\nBuildings: The Market
    lets you buy weapons for 3 Gold or ability scrolls for 4 Gold, with a 4-turn
    cooldown. The Bandit Den automatically steals a random item or Gold when you
    land \u2014 Wanderers are immune. The Shrine grants a free random ability charge
    then disappears, respawning after 5 turns. The Wandering Gambler lets you bet
    5 Gold on an odd or even dice roll, also with a 4-turn cooldown. Cities can also
    have Chests with free loot and Towers you can raid if you have enough weapons.\n\nAbilities:
    Used before your move each turn. Bribe steals 30\u201350% of your opponent's
    Gold. Ambush skips their next move. Teleport jumps you to any city instantly.
    Fortify protects you from enemy abilities for one turn."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
